    "description": "<p><b _msttexthash=\"129389\" _msthash=\"47\">Overview:</b></p><p _msttexthash=\"489824101\" _msthash=\"48\">Avoid wet saliva: This slow feeder has plates and water overflow holes, which can perfectly prevent pets' mouths from being wet and yellowing<br/>Waterproof and easy to clean: The dual design of a waterproof frame and floating plate effectively prevents overflow. Pet drinking fountains keep the floor clean and tidy. The pet water basin is easy to disassemble and assemble, suitable for weekly cleaning, and absolutely clean, to ensure the health of the pet<br/>Slow water intake: The design of the automatic adjustment floating plate can reduce the pet's drinking water speed. Floating cat water basins can prevent pets from suffocating and vomiting<br/>Large capacity: The large capacity is enough for pets to drink water throughout the day<br/>Perfect for all occasions: excellent splash-proof design and bottom non-slip mat ensure that it will not overflow even on rough roads. It is suitable for various vehicle environments, suitable for home, office, studio, outdoor travel, outing and other activities</p><p><b><br/></b></p><p><b _msttexthash=\"391235\" _msthash=\"49\">Product&nbsp;information</b><br/></p><p _msttexthash=\"4127370\" _msthash=\"50\">Name: Pet floating water bowl<br/>Color: gray/white/blue/pink<br/>Volume: 1.5L<br/>Material: ABS &amp; PP</p><p><b _msttexthash=\"182130\" _msthash=\"51\">Packing list</b><br/></p><p _msttexthash=\"157339\" _msthash=\"52\">Water bowl *1</p><p><img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/5c0b9697-84d1-4b6f-94ec-4d51211e8ed4.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"/><img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/0c3683cb-56d3-4268-889f-712b62ce8f84.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/7f8474a4-9b9a-40a7-84cd-a390aea57e26.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/da7288f1-bb61-438a-90b8-f11882de0939.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><img src=\"https://cf